get.description:
Return feature flag state and active model IDs.

Used by frontend to:
- Show/hide experimental features based on flag state
- Know which models are active (for logging, analytics)
- Verify backend connectivity

Returns:
    {
        "flags": {
            "per_room_ceiling": bool,
            "paint_class_inference": bool,
            ...
        },
        "models": {
            "pass1": "claude-opus-4-7",
            "pass2": "claude-opus-4-7",
        }
    }

post.description:
Issue (or refresh) a UUID share token for read-only viewing. Auth required.

Sprint §36 (2026-04-29): supports `expires_in_days` (default 30, 0 = no expiry).
Returns: {token, url, expires_at, view_count}
